# Pull Request Information

- **PR #**: 449
- **URL**: https://github.com/epam/dmtools-dart/pull/449
- **Title**: feat(config): interpolate $VAR in envVariables and use $ENV_VAR_*_QUEUE in fa runners
- **Author**: IstiN
- **Branch**: `feat/env-var-interpolation-and-queue` → `main`
- **State**: open
- **Files Changed**: 11
- **Additions**: +250
- **Deletions**: -142
- **Created**: 2026-10-22T09:27:41Z
- **Updated**: 2026-10-22T11:10:42Z

## PR Description

- Adds `$VAR` and `${VAR}` placeholder interpolation in `PropertyReader.resolveEnvVariables`, `PropertyReader.setOverrides`, `PropertyReader.runWithOverrides`, `CliAgent`, and `ToolBridge`.
- De-hardcodes `.dmtools/runners/fa-{bug-dev,story-dev,rework,review}.json` to reference `"$ENV_VAR_DEV_QUEUE"` and `"$ENV_VAR_REVIEW_QUEUE"` from repository variables instead of inline JSON queues and `FA_PROVIDER_TYPE` / `FA_PROVIDER_CONFIG`.
----
